      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Now Selling 3 Bedroom Mid Terrace Homes. Open Viewings, Saturday's 11.00-12.30. \r\n\r\nWe are delighted to introduce Chapel Park, an exclusive new development of spacious 3- & 4-bedroom family homes in Kinnegad, Co. Westmeath.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Chapel Park, a thoughtfully designed new development by Moylough Developments in the heart of Kinnegad. Created for contemporary family living, this well-connected development offers the ideal balance of modern comfort, community and village convenience. Residents will enjoy easy access to local schools, shops, cafés, childcare facilities and a wide range of everyday amenities, all close to home.\r\n\r\nThe development will comprise of a carefully considered collection of 3- & 4-bedroom homes, designed with modern lifestyles in mind. Each home will feature contemporary architecture, bright and welcoming interiors, stylish fitted kitchens and well-planned layouts that maximise space, comfort and natural light. A rated, energy-efficient construction is designed to deliver exceptional comfort while helping to reduce energy consumption and lower ongoing running costs.\r\n\r\nThe development will incorporate landscaped open spaces, pedestrian-friendly routes and attractive communal areas, creating a welcoming environment for residents of all ages. Chapel Park has been designed to encourage a strong sense of place, where families can enjoy a relaxed, connected and convenient way of life.\r\n\r\nKinnegad is a thriving and well-established town, offering an excellent selection of local amenities alongside strong transport connections. Located close to the M4 motorway, Chapel Park provides convenient access to Dublin, Mullingar, Enfield and surrounding employment centres, making it an attractive choice for commuters and families alike. Chapel Park is also a short distance from Enfield train station giving easy access to Connolly Station in Dublin city centre.\r\n\r\nThe town also benefits from a range of schools, sporting facilities, shops, cafés and community services, while the surrounding Westmeath countryside offers plenty of opportunities to enjoy outdoor pursuits and a more relaxed pace of life.\r\n\r\nMost homes at Chapel Park will be eligible for the Help to Buy scheme, making homeownership more accessible. With high energy-efficiency standards and A-rated BER performance, purchasers may also be able to benefit from Green Mortgage products, providing the potential for lower interest rates and long-term savings. Combining contemporary design with sustainable performance, Chapel Park represents an investment in both your lifestyle and your future.\r\n\r\nAll houses are eligible for the Help to Buy Incentive and Green Mortgages with some for the First Home Scheme.\r\n\r\nCoonan Property and Murtagh Bros are joint selling agents for Chapel Park.\r\n\r\nFor further details please register your interest at www.chapelpark.ie"
      },
